<odoo>
<record id="bank_match_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">erpec.bank.match.form</field><field name="model">erpec.bank.match</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form string="Conciliar pago registrado"><p>Selecciona el pago del mismo banco, empresa, moneda e importe. Los pagos parciales se concilian con sus movimientos bancarios individuales.</p><group><field name="statement_line_id"/><field name="payment_id"/></group><footer><button name="action_match" type="object" string="Conciliar" class="btn-primary"/><button string="Cancelar" special="cancel"/></footer></form></field></record>
<record id="statement_list" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">erpec.statement.list</field><field name="model">account.bank.statement.line</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><list><field name="date"/><field name="payment_ref"/><field name="journal_id"/><field name="partner_id"/><field name="amount"/><field name="is_reconciled"/><button name="action_erpec_match" type="object" string="Conciliar pago" invisible="is_reconciled"/></list></field></record>
<record id="statement_action" model="ir.actions.act_window"><field name="name">Movimientos bancarios</field><field name="res_model">account.bank.statement.line</field><field name="view_mode">list,form</field><field name="view_id" ref="statement_list"/></record>
<menuitem id="treasury_menu" name="Tesorería" parent="erpec_base.suite_root" sequence="18" groups="account.group_account_manager"/>
<menuitem id="statement_menu" name="Conciliar movimientos" parent="treasury_menu" action="statement_action"/>
<record id="disbursement_list" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">erpec.disbursement.list</field><field name="model">erpec.payroll.disbursement</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><list create="false" edit="false" delete="false"><field name="period_id"/><field name="employee_id"/><field name="amount"/><field name="residual"/><field name="status" widget="badge"/><button name="action_pay" type="object" string="Registrar pago" invisible="status in ['settled','reversed']"/></list></field></record>
<record id="disbursement_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">erpec.disbursement.form</field><field name="model">erpec.payroll.disbursement</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form create="false" edit="false" delete="false"><header><button name="action_pay" type="object" string="Registrar pago" class="btn-primary" invisible="status in ['settled','reversed']"/><button name="action_reverse" type="object" string="Revertir preparación" invisible="status == 'reversed'"/></header><sheet><group><field name="period_id"/><field name="employee_id"/><field name="amount"/><field name="residual"/><field name="status"/><field name="move_id"/><field name="reversal_id"/></group><p>Liquidar la cuenta por pagar no sustituye el cotejo del extracto. Completa la conciliación bancaria desde Tesorería.</p></sheet></form></field></record>
<record id="disbursement_action" model="ir.actions.act_window"><field name="name">Pagos de nómina</field><field name="res_model">erpec.payroll.disbursement</field><field name="view_mode">list,form</field></record>
<menuitem id="disbursement_menu" name="Pagos por empleado" parent="erpec_payroll.payroll_menu" action="disbursement_action" groups="erpec_payroll.group_payroll_manager"/>
<record id="bonus_settlement_list" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">erpec.payroll.bonus.settlement.list</field><field name="model">erpec.payroll.bonus.settlement</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><list><field name="name"/><field name="kind"/><field name="regime" optional="show"/><field name="date_from"/><field name="date_to"/><field name="deadline"/><field name="total"/><field name="state" widget="badge"/></list></field></record>
<record id="bonus_settlement_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">erpec.payroll.bonus.settlement.form</field><field name="model">erpec.payroll.bonus.settlement</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form><header><button name="action_compute" type="object" string="Calcular" class="btn-primary" invisible="state not in ('draft','computed')"/><button name="action_post" type="object" string="Contabilizar y preparar pagos" class="btn-primary" invisible="state != 'computed'" confirm="Se trasladará lo provisionado a nómina por pagar por empleado, con vencimiento en la fecha límite legal."/><button name="action_reverse" type="object" string="Revertir" invisible="state != 'posted'"/><field name="state" widget="statusbar"/></header><sheet><div class="alert alert-info" role="status"><field name="legal_notice" nolabel="1"/></div><group><group><field name="company_id" groups="base.group_multi_company"/><field name="kind" readonly="state != 'draft'"/><field name="regime" invisible="kind != 'fourteenth'" required="kind == 'fourteenth'" readonly="state != 'draft'"/><field name="year" readonly="state != 'draft'"/></group><group><field name="date_from" readonly="state not in ('draft','computed')"/><field name="date_to" readonly="state not in ('draft','computed')"/><field name="deadline" readonly="state not in ('draft','computed')"/><field name="total"/><field name="move_id" invisible="not move_id"/><field name="reversal_id" invisible="not reversal_id"/></group></group><field name="line_ids"><list create="false" delete="false"><field name="employee_id"/><field name="months"/><field name="amount"/><field name="residual"/><button name="action_pay" type="object" string="Registrar pago" invisible="residual == 0 or parent.state != 'posted'"/></list></field><p class="text-muted" invisible="line_ids">Sin empleados todavía: elige el décimo y el año, revisa el período y pulsa Calcular.</p></sheet></form></field></record>
<record id="bonus_settlement_action" model="ir.actions.act_window"><field name="name">Liquidación de décimos</field><field name="res_model">erpec.payroll.bonus.settlement</field><field name="view_mode">list,form</field><field name="help" type="html"><p>Aún no hay liquidaciones de décimos.</p><p>Crea una para pagar el décimo tercero (hasta el 24 de diciembre) o el décimo cuarto (15 de marzo en Costa e Insular, 15 de agosto en Sierra y Amazonía) con lo provisionado en las nóminas contabilizadas.</p></field></record>
<menuitem id="bonus_settlement_menu" name="Liquidación de décimos" parent="erpec_payroll.payroll_menu" action="bonus_settlement_action" groups="erpec_payroll.group_payroll_manager"/>
<record id="period_payments" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">erpec.payroll.period.payments</field><field name="model">erpec.payroll.period</field><field name="inherit_id" ref="erpec_payroll.period_form"/><field name="arch" type="xml"><xpath expr="//header" position="inside"><button name="action_prepare_payments" type="object" string="Preparar / abrir pagos" invisible="state != 'posted'" groups="erpec_payroll.group_payroll_manager"/></xpath><xpath expr="//sheet" position="inside"><field name="disbursement_ids" readonly="1" invisible="not disbursement_ids"/></xpath></field></record>
<record id="company_payroll" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">res.company.erpec.payroll.payable</field><field name="model">res.company</field><field name="inherit_id" ref="base.view_company_form"/><field name="arch" type="xml"><xpath expr="//notebook" position="inside"><page string="Pagos de nómina" groups="erpec_payroll.group_payroll_manager"><group><field name="erpec_payroll_payable_id"/><field name="erpec_payroll_bank_journal_id"/></group></page></xpath></field></record>
<record id="supplier_pending_list" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">erpec.supplier.pending.list</field><field name="model">account.move</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><list create="false"><field name="currency_id" column_invisible="True"/><field name="name" string="Documento"/><field name="partner_id" string="Proveedor"/><field name="move_type" string="Tipo"/><field name="invoice_date_due" string="Vencimiento"/><field name="amount_total" string="Total"/><field name="amount_residual" string="Saldo pendiente"/><field name="payment_state" widget="badge"/><field name="company_id" groups="base.group_multi_company" optional="hide"/></list></field></record>
<record id="supplier_pending_action" model="ir.actions.act_window"><field name="name">Proveedores: saldos pendientes</field><field name="res_model">account.move</field><field name="view_id" ref="supplier_pending_list"/><field name="view_mode">list,form</field><field name="domain">[('move_type','in',['in_invoice','in_refund']),('state','=','posted'),('amount_residual','&gt;',0)]</field><field name="context">{'default_move_type':'in_invoice'}</field><field name="help" type="html"><p>No hay facturas ni notas de crédito de proveedor con saldo pendiente.</p><p>Los anticipos se consultan en Pagos y anticipos. Aplica las notas de crédito antes de determinar el importe a transferir.</p></field></record>
<record id="supplier_payments_list" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">erpec.treasury.payments.list</field><field name="model">account.payment</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><list><field name="currency_id" column_invisible="True"/><field name="date"/><field name="name" string="Pago"/><field name="partner_id" string="Beneficiario"/><field name="memo" string="Referencia"/><field name="journal_id"/><field name="payment_type" string="Sentido" optional="hide"/><field name="amount" string="Importe"/><field name="state" widget="badge"/></list></field></record>
<record id="supplier_payments_action" model="ir.actions.act_window"><field name="name">Pagos y anticipos</field><field name="res_model">account.payment</field><field name="view_id" ref="supplier_payments_list"/><field name="view_mode">list,form</field><field name="domain">[('partner_type','=','supplier')]</field><field name="context">{'default_partner_type':'supplier','default_payment_type':'outbound'}</field></record>
<menuitem id="supplier_pending_menu" name="Proveedores: saldos pendientes" parent="treasury_menu" action="supplier_pending_action" sequence="10"/>
<menuitem id="supplier_payments_menu" name="Pagos y anticipos" parent="treasury_menu" action="supplier_payments_action" sequence="20"/>
<record id="partner_bank_form_erpec" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">res.partner.bank.form.erpec</field><field name="model">res.partner.bank</field><field name="inherit_id" ref="base.view_partner_bank_form"/><field name="arch" type="xml"><xpath expr="//field[@name='acc_number']" position="after"><field name="erpec_bank_key"/><field name="erpec_account_type"/></xpath></field></record>
<record id="bank_export_wizard_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">erpec.bank.export.wizard.form</field><field name="model">erpec.bank.export.wizard</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form string="Generar archivo de pago bancario"><p>Genera el archivo plano de pago de nómina para un banco con ficha técnica oficial verificada. Solo incluye pagos pendientes del período con cuenta y tipo de cuenta configurados; no ejecuta ningún pago.</p><group><field name="company_id" groups="base.group_multi_company"/><field name="bank"/><field name="period_id"/></group><footer><button name="action_generate" type="object" string="Generar" class="btn-primary"/><button string="Cancelar" special="cancel"/></footer></form></field></record>
<record id="bank_export_wizard_action" model="ir.actions.act_window"><field name="name">Generar archivo de pago bancario</field><field name="res_model">erpec.bank.export.wizard</field><field name="view_mode">form</field><field name="target">new</field></record>
<record id="bank_export_batch_list" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">erpec.bank.export.batch.list</field><field name="model">erpec.bank.export.batch</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><list create="false" edit="false" delete="false"><field name="name"/><field name="bank"/><field name="period_id"/><field name="total_amount"/><field name="checksum"/><field name="create_uid_name"/><field name="create_date"/></list></field></record>
<record id="bank_export_batch_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">erpec.bank.export.batch.form</field><field name="model">erpec.bank.export.batch</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form create="false" edit="false" delete="false"><sheet><group><field name="name"/><field name="bank"/><field name="period_id"/><field name="total_amount"/><field name="checksum"/><field name="create_uid_name"/></group><field name="file" filename="filename"/><field name="filename" invisible="1"/><field name="line_ids" readonly="1"><list><field name="sequence"/><field name="employee_id"/><field name="id_type"/><field name="id_number"/><field name="account_number"/><field name="account_type"/><field name="amount"/></list></field></sheet></form></field></record>
<record id="bank_export_batch_action" model="ir.actions.act_window"><field name="name">Archivos bancarios generados</field><field name="res_model">erpec.bank.export.batch</field><field name="view_mode">list,form</field></record>
<menuitem id="bank_export_menu" name="Archivo de pago bancario (nómina)" parent="treasury_menu" action="bank_export_wizard_action" sequence="30" groups="erpec_payroll.group_payroll_manager"/>
<menuitem id="bank_export_batch_menu" name="Archivos bancarios generados" parent="treasury_menu" action="bank_export_batch_action" sequence="31" groups="erpec_payroll.group_payroll_manager"/>
<record id="home_treasury" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">erpec.home.treasury</field><field name="model">erpec.workspace</field><field name="inherit_id" ref="erpec_workspace.home_form"/><field name="arch" type="xml">
<xpath expr="//h2[.='Personas y nómina']/following-sibling::div" position="inside"><button name="%(disbursement_action)d" type="action" string="Pagos por empleado" class="btn btn-outline-primary" groups="erpec_payroll.group_payroll_manager"/></xpath>
<xpath expr="//h2[.='Nómina · Validación pendiente']/following-sibling::p" position="replace"><p>El cálculo, asiento y pagos por empleado están disponibles. Completa el cotejo del extracto en Tesorería. La equivalencia laboral integral continúa pendiente antes de operar empresas reales.</p></xpath>
<xpath expr="//field[@name='company_readiness']/.." position="before"><div class="border rounded p-3 mb-3" groups="account.group_account_manager"><h2>Tesorería</h2><p>Revisa las facturas y notas de crédito pendientes, registra pagos o anticipos y concilia cada movimiento del extracto. La consulta de pagos incluye proveedores y nómina, identificados por beneficiario y referencia.</p><button name="%(supplier_pending_action)d" type="action" string="Saldos de proveedores" class="btn btn-outline-primary"/><button name="%(supplier_payments_action)d" type="action" string="Pagos y anticipos" class="btn btn-outline-primary"/><button name="%(statement_action)d" type="action" string="Conciliar movimientos" class="btn btn-outline-primary"/><p class="mt-3"><strong>Archivo de pago bancario (nómina)</strong><br/>Disponible con ficha técnica oficial verificada para Banco Pichincha, Produbanco y Banco General Rumiñahui, solo para beneficiarios en el mismo banco (asigna antes al diario bancario de nómina su cuenta con el perfil de archivo de pago y, en cada empleado, su cuenta con tipo ahorros/corriente y su tipo de identificación). Banco Guayaquil tiene sus campos identificados pero el delimitador del archivo no está confirmado por el banco, así que su perfil queda bloqueado. Pacífico, Internacional y Bolivariano y los pagos a proveedores siguen sin ficha técnica pública suficiente. Generar el archivo no ejecuta ningún pago; el pago contable, el resultado del banco y la conciliación del extracto siguen siendo pasos separados.</p><button name="%(bank_export_wizard_action)d" type="action" string="Generar archivo de pago bancario" class="btn btn-outline-primary" groups="account.group_account_manager"/></div></xpath>
</field></record>
</odoo>
